# --- Pre-PC-reset backup hygiene (2026-09-29) -------------------------------
# Appended, nothing above was removed. Defensive rules for categories the
# file did not previously cover, so a future `git add -A` cannot sweep them in.
# NOTE: no blanket `build/` rule on purpose. The only `build/` directory in
# this repo is packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/doom-overlay/doom/build/,
# which holds a committed Emscripten artefact (doom.js + doom.wasm). Its
# sources (doomgeneric/*.c) are NOT vendored here and build.sh needs both an
# emscripten toolchain and a network clone, so the committed files are the
# captured vendor material the example needs to run. Do not ignore them.

# Environment files (only bare .env was covered above)
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
!.env.*.example
!.env.*.sample
!.env.*.template

